# Runner state
run_all_status.txt
run_all_expected.txt

# Runtime artifacts produced by the suites. qa/README.md states that generated
# datasets, workbooks and graphs are ignored; before this file said so, only the
# two runner status files above were listed, so an interrupted run left tracked-
# looking debris in a directory that is supposed to hold only sources and
# preregistered evidence. (audit IIVW-19)
#
# Suites now write their accumulators to tempfiles, so these patterns are the
# backstop for exports, graphs and probe output rather than the primary defence.
*.dta
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.gph
*.png
*.pdf
*.svg

# Preregistered coverage evidence is NOT disposable: it is the receipt a release
# claim is made against. Re-admit everything under coverage_results/.
!coverage_results/**
